      "writtenOn": "2026-03-11T20:24:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can pack this much tighter. I think it would be reasonable to limit this to uint8_t for the page index, and then fX and fY could be uint8_t or uint8_16.\n\nThe choice for fX and fY depends on how PlotCoord is used. Does it describe the top-left coordinate of each plot in a texture? Or is it a plot-relative pixel location? For plot positions within a texture, I\u0027d think we\u0027re never going to see more than 255x255 plots and could then enforce it when creating the DrawAtlas.\n\nIf it\u0027s a coord within the plot itself, then I think we\u0027d need more bits than 8.",
